982_0b31ef-be > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;}}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1982_0b31ef-be\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Bullion Portfolio Trading LLC \u2013 Precious Metals Excellence Since 1998<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bullion Portfolio Trading LLC is your trusted partner for investment and collectible coins, as well as bullion bars and customized minting solutions. As a family-owned company with German roots, we have combined decades of experience, in-depth expertise and an international network since 1998 \u2013 now operating from the heart of Dubai.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Under the leadership of Carolin Schwarz, Bullion Portfolio Trading LLC continues the successful business model and extensive industry knowledge of her father, Henry Schwarz \u2013 founder and CEO of the renowned GfM Gesellschaft f\u00fcr M\u00fcnzeditionen GmbH \/ Anlagegold24 \u2013 bringing this legacy to the United Arab Emirates. In doing so, we unite German precision and quality with global reach.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As an official distributor of leading mints, we offer our clients not only LBMA-certified investment-grade bullion bars, but also exclusive, limited-edition collectible coins and the latest releases of investment coins, including Maple Leaf, Britannia, Kangaroo, Vienna Philharmonic and Krugerrand.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exclusively available through us is also one of only three existing 100 kg Big Maple Leaf coins in the world \u2013 a coin of extraordinary size and rarity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Bullion Portfolio Trading LLC, you will find a competent, reliable and personal partner who supports you with passion and expertise. Personal consultation, tailor-made solutions, and the highest level of discretion are always our top priorities.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n<style>.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col{display:flex;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col,.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col > .kb-image-is-ratio-size{align-self:stretch;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col > .wp-block-kadence-advancedgallery{align-self:stretch;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col > .aligncenter{width:100%;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col:before{opacity:0.3;}.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b{position:relative;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b > .kt-inside-inner-col{flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;}}<\/style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1982_3d8a0b-1b\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\"><style>.kb-image1982_87adf9-ca .kb-image-has-overlay:after{opacity:0.3;}<\/style>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image1982_87adf9-ca size-full\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"750\" src=\"https:\/\/bpt-shop.ae\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/BPT-Team-0002.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-1995\" srcset=\"https:\/\/bpt-shop.ae\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/BPT-Team-0002.jpg 500w, https:\/\/bpt-shop.ae\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/BPT-Team-0002-200x300.jpg 200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt